# Installed payload. Fetched or built on the machine that needs it, never
# committed: ffmpeg is ~300 MB, the voice engine's weights are ~2.5 GB, and the
# compiled C++ engine is machine-specific. `realme engine install` and
# `_get_ffmpeg.bat` recreate all of it.
tools/
03_App/tools/

# Secrets.
.env
*.env
!03_App/example.env

